n = Unique (Lasts like a normal Nimbus Impression)<br /> Potency = Prime<br /> Scale = All extra factors to Scale<br /> Range = Touch<br /> Casting Time = Instant (Reach to Instant Casting)<br /> <br /> NOTE: Creates artwork form the Nimbus. The shape and details of the signature, as long as it related to the themes of the nimbus. For example, one with a Nimbus of an angel protector may make angelic statues, shields, feelings of warmth and safety, or the sensation that one is being watched over, perhaps all at the same time. The artwork can create emotional conditions, much like other kinds of artwork.<br /> COMMENTARY: The first Artwork. (no, I couldn't think of a better name) </div></div> </div> </div><br /> (Space \u25cf\u25cf)<br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\"><u><i>Locate Object</i></u><br /> Potency = N/A (1)<br /> Duration = Space<br /> Scale = All extra factors to Scale<br /> Range 