ype=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\"> <u><i> Perfect Sympathy </i></u><br /> Duration = Space (Reach to Advanced Duration)<br /> Potency = N/A (1)<br /> Range = Self<br /> Casting Time = Instant (Reach to Instant Casting)<br /> Extra: (Reach for medium sympathy)<br /> NOTE: Nimbus Imprinted objects have Medium Sympathy, Nimbus Art may be higher.<br /> <br /> COMMENTARY:</div></div> </div> </div><br /> <i>True Beauty Unveiled </i><br /> (Prime \u25cf\u25cf\u25cf\u25cf\u25cf) 10<u> \u25cf of Nimbus Merits </u><br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\"><u><i> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/877640-creative-thaumaturgy-fallen-world-edition?p=1473606#post1473606\">Display Halo</a> </i></u><br /> Duration = All extra factors to Duration (Reach to Advanced Duration)<br /> Potency = Prime<br /> Range = Touch<br /> Casting Time = Instant (Reach to Instant Casting)<br /> Extra: (Reach for relative conditions)<br /> <br /> NOTE:<br /> COMMENTARY: </div></div> </div> </div><br /> (Space \u25cf\u25cf\u25cf\u25cf\u25cf)<br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\"> <u><i> Teleportation </i></u><br /> Duration = N/A (1)<br /> Potency = Space<br /> Range = Sympathetic ( Nimbus Art Only)<br /> Casting Time = Instant (Reach to Instant Casting)<br /> NOTE:<br /> <br /> COMMENTARY:</div></div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <b>Secrets and Storyhooks</b><br /> \u25cf A well respected, but ageing Coronal has announced their retirement, along with their plans to more or less permanently move to a pocket dimension of their own creation, leaving their sanctum estate to their apprentice. Their apprentice, however seemingly wants nothing to do with the place, and privately seeks out several up and coming cabals to challenge them to find and return a specific Grimoire to them from inside the estate. Do that, and the Sanctum is theirs. What could possibly motivate the apprentice to give up such a prime location? What's in the Grimoire? How does one even make it past the foyer mobius strip?<br /> <br /> \u25cf The local Spinner has gone rapt. At least that's what everyone assumes, when their Artwork all simultaneously burst open like a over ripe fruit, leaking raw Supernal energy into the nearby surroundings. Worse still, they appear to have been way way more productive than anyone thought, with their Art showing up in large quantities in the absolutely weirdest places. Some even reappear after being destroyed. No one can seem to find the Spinner, and people are starting to get desperate.<br /> <br /> \u25cf[WIP]<br /> <br /> Yes, I'm stealing Cauthon's formating style. No, I'm not ashamed.<br /> <br /> For those wondering &quot;what is this? and why?&quot;, the answers are niche Nimbus Artists, and because why not. Really this is just an idea that popped into my head, and I wanted to share it. I find the Nimbus to be very cool, if a bit under utilized.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>To whomever reads this, I hope you have a good day/night. May you be Happy.<br /> <br /> So, I made some Mage Legacies <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1497183-templebuilder-s-new-legacy-thread#post1497183\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>, with some help. They vary in quality, but I hope you take a look at them. Every one contains pieces of me, for better or worse.","edited":{"userid":26736,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26736-templebuilder","user":"TempleBuilder","date":". 11-15-2022, 10:05 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26736-templebuilder","name":"TempleBuilder","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar26736_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2021"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1251"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-11-15T12:50:05-08:00","id":1497206,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>TempleBuilder</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1497183-templebuilder-s-new-legacy-thread?p=1497202#post1497202\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Yes, I'm stealing Cauthon's formating style. No, I'm not ashamed.</div> </div> </div> </div>It's a busy style, but thorough, by gum. Always show your work!","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divid