. They accomplish this with clever use of perspective and selective Bans and Keyed effects.</div> </div> </div> </div> Antichamber? Lets look that...yeah, it's pretty much that. The Spinners aren't directly associated with the Arrow, but the few that wind up there often do extremely well at Sanctum defense. Seriously, these are the kind of people to make brain bending effects for fun. Never mind the fun game of &quot;guess what's safe to examine, and what will give you a -12 spread around your stats and skills as a persistent condition&quot;, and spaces infused with spells that make even more conditions appear.<br /> <br /> Edit: I kinda intended for them to be rather unassuming at a first glance, but rather terrifying when one logically thinks out their powers.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>To whomever reads this, I hope you have a good day/night. May you be Happy.<br /> <br /> So, I made some Mage Legacies <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1497183-templebuilder-s-new-legacy-thread#post1497183\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>, with some help. They vary in quality, but I hope you take a look at them. Every one contains pieces of me, for better or worse.","edited":{"userid":26736,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26736-templebuilder","user":"TempleBuilder","date":". 11-15-2022, 08:51 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26736-templebuilder","name":"TempleBuilder","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar26736_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2021"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1251"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-11-18T14:15:43-08:00","id":1497487,"title":"","content":"<span style=\"font-size:18px\">WIP Legacies </span><br /> Going to use the spot as a place to flesh out legacy ideas-feel free